{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415732","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415732","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041573201:1":{"text":"ふむ、悪くない場所だのぅ。ま、辛気くさい図書館と比べたら、どこもマシに見えるというものだ。","source_cn":"这地方可真不错，当然了，跟死气沉沉的图书馆相比，哪里都好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E18EB893F5346DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573202:1":{"text":"……ん？こいつは珍しい匂いだのぅ。竜の卵の甘ったるい生臭さの奥に、ほんのり爽やかな香りが混ざっておる……","source_cn":"……嗯？稀奇的味道。龙蛋液的腥甜底下，掺着一缕……薄暮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0725F5F5DB5B1302","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573203:1":{"text":"これは……サロクディア！？","source_cn":"唔……萨……萨洛克兰？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF21DAA9C7404DC81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573204:1":{"text":"『エスペリア見聞録大全』で確認したから間違いない。おぬし、あの謎の地下王国から来たのであろう！？","source_cn":"没错，检索了《伊索米亚见闻记录大全》，你来自那座神秘的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0CC6ADDF8E735B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573205:1":{"text":"並外れた鋭さは、時としていらん危険を招くぞ。","source_cn":"过人的敏锐，同时也是多余的危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE6A572EFEA0A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573206:1":{"text":"そう気を張るな、若いの。わしはただ、サロクディアに少し興味があるだけだ。","source_cn":"别紧张呀小家伙。莱希拉姆的校规只管书架间不准喧哗，可管...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE92A3778CF1F432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573207:1":{"text":"それで、数千年生きたおぬしらの女王様は卵白を飲むとき、砂糖と塩、どっちを入れるのが好きなのだ？","source_cn":"我只是好奇，那位活了上千岁的女王，享用龙蛋液时，是喜欢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF950E901ACF929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573208:1":{"text":"言葉には気をつけろ。","source_cn":"你应当注意言辞。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D9C3CA5750D14F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573209:1":{"text":"過ぎた好奇心は、不利益しか生まんぞ。","source_cn":"好奇心过盛毫无益处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA53AB39FC5C6E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573210:1":{"text":"分かった分かった。では、誠意のしるしに、重要な校則の秘密と引き換えでどうだ？","source_cn":"好吧好吧，为表诚意，我用一条重量级的校规秘密和你交换。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98CD9CFF93532060","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573211:1":{"text":"たとえば……第四十一条第二項目、錬金術の授業でくしゃみをしてはならない！","source_cn":"比如……校规第四十一条第二款，炼金课禁止打喷嚏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A43B0FCC61C90A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041573212:1":{"text":"理由を知りたいか？さっきの質問に答えてくれたら教えてやる。悪くない取引であろう？","source_cn":"想知道原因吗？跟我说说就告诉你，这笔买卖怎么样，很划算吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE318B6F1E4CC838","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041573213:1":{"text":"女王陛下の恩恵により賜ったこの命、その御嗜好を論じる資格などない。","source_cn":"女王的恩典赋予我生命，而非谈论她喜好的权利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE524544319C20A4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041573214:1":{"text":"妄言はそこまでにしろ、カタストロフ。","source_cn":"妄言适可而止，恶魔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCE6229191FD0EA0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041573215:1":{"text":"そんなに怒らなくても……なら、もっと他愛ない質問に変えよう。","source_cn":"哎呀，别生气嘛，那换一点无关紧要的问题好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7644E932AB39DAC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041573216:1":{"text":"おぬしら、寿命の長いエクシルは、何歳で定年退職するのだ？","source_cn":"既然你们萨洛克兰人的寿命那么长，那一般多少岁退休